[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "text": "Lesson 79.",
    "start": 0.69,
    "end": 3.362,
    "zh": "第79课。",
    "zh_hant": "第79課。"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "text": "Carol's shopping list.",
    "start": 3.412,
    "end": 5.873,
    "zh": "卡罗尔的购物清单。",
    "zh_hant": "卡羅爾的購物清單。"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "text": "Listen to the tape then",
    "start": 6.693,
    "end": 9.515,
    "zh": "听磁带，然后",
    "zh_hant": "聽磁帶，然後"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "answer this question.",
    "start": 9.295,
    "end": 11.295,
    "zh": "回答这个问题。",
    "zh_hant": "回答這個問題。"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "What is Carol not going to buy?",
    "start": 12.216,
    "end": 15.998,
    "zh": "卡罗尔不打算买什么？",
    "zh_hant": "卡羅爾不打算買什麼？"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "What are you doing, Carol?",
    "start": 17.939,
    "end": 20.42,
    "zh": "你在干什么，卡罗尔？",
    "zh_hant": "你在幹什麼，卡羅爾？"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "I'm making a shopping list, Tom.",
    "start": 21.821,
    "end": 25.443,
    "zh": "我在列购物清单，汤姆。",
    "zh_hant": "我在列購物清單，湯姆。"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "What do we need?",
    "start": 26.443,
    "end": 28.304,
    "zh": "我们需要什么？",
    "zh_hant": "我們需要什麼？"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "We need a lot of things this week.",
    "start": 29.525,
    "end": 33.166,
    "zh": "这周我们需要很多东西。",
    "zh_hant": "這周我們需要很多東西。"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "I must go to the grocer's.",
    "start": 33.767,
    "end": 36.728,
    "zh": "我得去食品杂货店。",
    "zh_hant": "我得去食品雜貨店。"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "We haven't got much tea or coffee,",
    "start": 37.189,
    "end": 40.791,
    "zh": "我们的茶和咖啡不多了，",
    "zh_hant": "我們的茶和咖啡不多了，"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "and we haven't got any sugar or jam.",
    "start": 41.211,
    "end": 45.093,
    "zh": "而且也没有糖和果酱了。",
    "zh_hant": "而且也沒有糖和果醬了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "What about vegetables?",
    "start": 46.574,
    "end": 48.915,
    "zh": "蔬菜呢？",
    "zh_hant": "蔬菜呢？"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "I must go to the greengroce's.",
    "start": 49.515,
    "end": 52.977,
    "zh": "我得去蔬菜水果店。",
    "zh_hant": "我得去蔬菜水果店。"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "We haven't got many tomatoes,",
    "start": 53.477,
    "end": 56.698,
    "zh": "我们的西红柿不多了，",
    "zh_hant": "我們的西紅柿不多了，"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "but we've got a lot of potatoes.",
    "start": 56.919,
    "end": 60.64,
    "zh": "但土豆还有很多。",
    "zh_hant": "但土豆還有很多。"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "text": "I must go to the butcher's, too.",
    "start": 61.621,
    "end": 64.702,
    "zh": "我还得去肉店。",
    "zh_hant": "我還得去肉店。"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "text": "We need some meat.",
    "start": 65.423,
    "end": 67.704,
    "zh": "我们需要一些肉。",
    "zh_hant": "我們需要一些肉。"
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "text": "We haven't got any meat at all.",
    "start": 68.184,
    "end": 71.766,
    "zh": "我们一点肉都没有了。",
    "zh_hant": "我們一點肉都沒有了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "text": "Have we got any beer and wine?",
    "start": 73.307,
    "end": 76.888,
    "zh": "我们有啤酒和葡萄酒吗？",
    "zh_hant": "我們有啤酒和葡萄酒嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "text": "No, we haven't.",
    "start": 77.329,
    "end": 79.67,
    "zh": "没有，我们没有。",
    "zh_hant": "沒有，我們沒有。"
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "text": "And I'm not going to get any!",
    "start": 79.731,
    "end": 82.815,
    "zh": "而且我不打算买任何酒！",
    "zh_hant": "而且我不打算買任何酒！"
  },
  {
    "index": 22,
    "text": "I hope that you've got some money.",
    "start": 83.777,
    "end": 86.44,
    "zh": "我希望你有一些钱。",
    "zh_hant": "我希望你有一些錢。"
  },
  {
    "index": 23,
    "text": "I haven't got much.",
    "start": 87.262,
    "end": 89.324,
    "zh": "我的钱不多。",
    "zh_hant": "我的錢不多。"
  },
  {
    "index": 24,
    "text": "Well, I haven't got much either!",
    "start": 89.525,
    "end": 93.23,
    "zh": "嗯，我的钱也不多！",
    "zh_hant": "嗯，我的錢也不多！"
  }
]
